SUMMARY:Volunteer Appreciation Cookout
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Williamson Nature Preserve in celebration of you!\nWe invite you to help us celebrate and appreciate all of the hard work that our volunteers have donated to TLC!  We have accomplished so much this year and could not have done it without the dedication of community members like you. Please bring those that you want to celebrate with you\, even if they aren't TLC volunteers. We will have food\, lawn games\, and awards presented to some special volunteers. Please register at the link below to save your spot!
URL:https://triangleland.org/event/volunteer-appreciation-cookout
LOCATION:Williamson Nature Preserve [Staff Entrance]\, 4429 Old Country Mial Rd\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27610\, United States
ORGANIZER;CN="Amaya Horner":MAILTO:ahorner@triangleland.org
END:VEVENT
