SUMMARY:Women's Social Hike
DESCRIPTION:Join TLC for a women's social hike!\nMeet other nature-loving women on this 3-mile hike through Brumley North Nature Preserve.  This moderately paced hike will meander through hardwood forests\, along tranquil Stony Creek\, and through pollinator meadows. This is a free event\, but preregistration is required. \n \nIf registration for this event is full\, please fill out the waitlist form here by June 2nd at noon. \n 
URL:https://triangleland.org/event/womens-social-hike-5
LOCATION:Brumley North Nature Preserve\, 3620 Old State Highway 10\, Chapel Hill\, NC\, 27514\, United States
CATEGORIES:Hike,Social,Training,Workshop
ORGANIZER;CN="Amaya Horner":MAILTO:ahorner@triangleland.org
END:VEVENT
